
/**
 * ICT-Reverse Style Backtester - Strategy v2
 *
 * RULES INTEGRATED
 *
 * DAILY S/R
 * - Maximum 2-year lookback
 * - Minimum 5 separate confirmed rejection visits
 * - Minimum 6-day separation between rejection visits
 * - Pass-through does NOT disqualify a zone
 * - NASDAQ significant rejection = 650+ points
 * - US30 significant rejection = 1,000+ points
 * - Maximum S/R zone width:
 *      NASDAQ = 30 points
 *      US30   = 50 points
 * - A line uses the exact line price.
 * - A zone uses its 50% midpoint for entry.
 *
 * 1H MARKET STRUCTURE
 * - Clear trend required.
 * - Choppy/range conditions are ignored.
 * - Bullish = HH + HL structure.
 * - Bearish = LL + LH structure.
 * - Confirmed swings only; no future candles may be used.
 *
 * FIBONACCI
 * - Bullish = most recent HL -> HH
 * - Bearish = most recent LH -> LL
 *
 * SETUP A
 * - Daily S/R is in the appropriate H1 premium/discount area.
 * - Entry occurs when price touches the predefined S/R entry price.
 * - No confirmation candle.
 *
 * SETUP B
 * - Price has moved from a Daily S/R.
 * - No qualifying Daily S/R exists in the Setup-A target area.
 * - MSS occurs.
 * - Bullish: 2 successive HH + HL.
 * - Bearish: 2 successive LL + LH.
 * - Entry at 0.5 Fib.
 * - No confirmation candle.
 *
 * EXECUTION
 * - Entry occurs intrabar.
 * - If price gaps beyond the entry without touching it, trade is forfeited.
 * - Same candle hitting SL and TP = SL first.
 *
 * RISK
 * - Starting capital = $10,000
 * - Fixed $100 risk per trade.
 * - NO compounding.
 * - SL = 200 points.
 * - TP = 600 points.
 * - RR = 1:3.
 *
 * MULTIPLE TRADES
 * - Maximum one open trade per asset.
 * - NASDAQ and US30 may have simultaneous trades.
 *
 * NEWS
 * - CPI, FOMC and NFP only.
 * - No new entries 30 minutes before or after release.
 * - NEWS_EVENTS below must contain verified UTC release times.
 *
 * NO TIME FILTER
 * - No 8am-7pm restriction.
 * - No whole-day holiday filter.
 */

